### 1. Отримати всі елементи (GET all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Accept: application/json

### 2. Отримати елемент за ID (GET by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Створити новий елемент (POST create)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "name4",
  "description": "description4"
}

### 4. Оновити елемент (PUT update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "name1-updated",
  "description": "description1-updated"
}

### 5. Видалити елемент за ID (DELETE by ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/4

### 6. Перевірити, що елемент видалено
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/4
Accept: application/json
